WEBVTT

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:42.610
Her pulse and blood pressure are both normal.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.330
Why?

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.610
Why did I...?

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.160
Yuuma-kun...

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.410
Sumomo!

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.790
Sumomo-chan!

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.910
It went back.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.970
What was that just now?

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:22.490
<b>The Past</b>

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.320
Excuse me, I'm Kohinata Sumomo's mother.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:33.730
Your daughter is completely healthy from a medical perspective.

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:35.510
I see...

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:37.660
But only from a medical perspective.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.520
SIGN:  Examination Room

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.280
Yuuma-kun!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:53.670
Mom...

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:55.070
It's happening again!

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.650
Sumomo-chan!

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.290
Sumomo-chan!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:13.580
We believe that there is some magical cause, and have no way to counteract it.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.680
No!

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.760
Yuuma-kun!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:19.230
Wait!

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:27.780
Magic can make people around you miserable even if that's not what you intended!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.740
That's why I-!

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:37.380
Yuuma-kun...

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.350
Yuuma-kun!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.900
Students who have finished cleaning up, please return home immediately.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.080
Where did Yuuma go?

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:58.870
And where did Haruhi-chan and Shinya-kun and his sister go?

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:05.530
You guys are still here?

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:06.630
Sensei.

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:09.930
If you've finished cleaning up, go on home.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:13.540
But Yuuma, Kohinata-kun and the others...

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:21.890
Oh, I just got a call from them a little while ago.
His sister wasn't feeling well so he went straight home.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.820
S-Sumomo-chan?

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:27.350
They said it was nothing bad, so don't worry.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.200
That's good...

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.470
But man, that Yuuma...

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.720
He should've said something.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:45.640
It's just that he was worried about Sumomo-chan.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.740
What's wrong?

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:52.910
That's...

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:08.910
Well?

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.790
I'm sorry, Anri-chan.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.960
Even after you brought these for me...

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.590
They weren't useful.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:18.420
I think it's some kind of out of body projection.

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.320
If only I could contact Minagi-sensei.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.630
Why is she going on a business trip at a time like this?

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.220
Anri-chan...

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.100
Doctor!  It's happening again.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.130
Sumomo-chan...

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.950
No, any further and...

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:46.140
Sumomo-chan, no!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.840
<i>El Amnia Aphragia.</i>

00:05:53.290 --> 00:06:02.580
<i>Ri Lefels Admantias Rury Kartia Ridiadi Amslei.</i>

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:09.990
That voice...

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:13.230
Minagi-sensei!

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.280
Weren't you on a trip?

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:19.580
I had a bad feeling, so I rushed home.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.260
Suzuri-chan...

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.430
I'm sorry I'm late, Otoha...

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.630
Suzuri-chan?

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.210
Otoha?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.820
They seem really close.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.970
You saved her.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:35.240
We couldn't deal with it.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.940
That was just a temporary measure.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:43.670
Her psyche and physical body separate at the slightest stimulation.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:48.970
Like the smell of a hospital's medicine, the atmosphere in a given place...

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.310
What should we do?

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.530
Suzuri-chan...

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:57.910
We need to take her to the place where she's most calm.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.460
Sumomo-chan...

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:09.970
It's true that you're most calm in your own room.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:16.660
But just like I said earlier her psyche will separate from her body very easily.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.830
We can't be sure it will be safe here either.

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:24.250
I'm worried about the possibility of her psyche separating from her body and never coming back.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:27.690
If that happens, she'll...

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.120
That can't happen!

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.860
Sumomo-chan, come back!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.960
Otoha, don't do anything to excite her.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.370
I've never seen such an unstable situation.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.800
She must've been exposed to a very great power.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.250
It was Yuuma-kun, wasn't it?

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.390
How did you know?

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.310
But he can't use magic, can he?

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.870
It's not that he can't, it's that he doesn't.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:15.410
In terms of pure talent he's probably the strongest in the school... No, one of the strongest in Japan.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.160
Yuuma-kun is?

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.330
SIGN:  Watarase

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.600
Yuuma!

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.990
I put a change of clothes here for you.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.400
Don't worry, they're for men.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:44.020
I bought them at the convenience store.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.720
Yuuma!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.360
Want me to wash your back!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.660
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.570
Come on, we're both men...

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.290
W-Wait!

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:07.990
Don't be a man only when it suits you!

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:12.500
Hey, Jun.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.750
At times like this, you need to leave a guy alone.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.350
Hachi?

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:22.740
So how do you know this?

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:30.490
I think we can tell them.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.320
I suppose so.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.400
Yuuma-kun isn't my real son.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:44.180
That's right.  Sumomo-chan didn't used to have a brother.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.620
Yuuma-kun is my son.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:49.470
Yours, Minagi-sensei?

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.390
Yes.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.950
And he was born with my talent for magic.

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.580
But...

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:05.120
It's very hard for a child to master magic.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:13.390
They're very young mentally, and when you have as much talent as Yuuma-kun does...

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:18.700
You don't know what will happen if you let your feelings control your magic.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:25.820
So I raised Yuuma-kun to never use magic.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:34.660
But he learned magical spells by watching me.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:40.180
And then it happened.

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:54.920
I'm a complete fool.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:58.650
Nothing's changed since then.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:04.440
I decided I'd never use magic again.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:08.390
Yuuma-kun used magic...

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:14.170
...at a nearby park to raise some boys high into the air.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.150
And after that...

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:31.550
He raised everything around him into the air as well.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:39.490
The boys were unhurt, but their parents were very upset and made quite a big deal about it.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:45.420
And the people from the park complained as well.  It was a difficult time.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.540
That certainly was a problem.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:52.400
Using magic to mess up a park just for fun...

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.420
No, it wasn't just for fun!

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:56.860
Wh-What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:02.450
Yuuma-kun didn't use magic just for fun.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.530
He did it to save me!

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.460
Haruhi-chan...

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.030
Yuuma's a transfer student.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.290
I heard about that.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:26.460
I think it was second grade when he came to our class.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:27.380
NAME ON BOARD:  Kohinata Yuuma

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:29.770
He was pretty gloomy and unhappy.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:34.780
I thought he was kind of hard to deal with.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.740
But you got to be friends with him right away, didn't you?

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:42.620
Well, I...

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:45.820
I just can't leave people like that alone.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:52.160
Nah, we don't have to talk about me right now.

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:56.600
I heard this later, but he told me what happened.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:13:02.300
That he had to live apart from his mother because of something he'd done.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:09.540
That's how he was when he transferred to my school.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.300
So don't try to force anything out of him.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:15.120
Let's just stay with him.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:16.500
Yeah.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.210
I see.  So that's what happened.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:24.850
I knew he wouldn't use magic without a good reason.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:33.320
I decided to be a mage after seeing his magic because I thought that magic was wonderful...

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:37.520
But after that he stopped using magic entirely.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:39.280
It's ironic.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:46.180
That wasn't why you and Yuuma-kun had to live apart, was it?

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.290
I can't say that it was unconnected,

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:53.400
but there was something else that happened right before that was the direct cause.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:54.860
Something else?

00:13:55.240 --> 00:14:00.650
Yes, the reason that Mizuhosaka Academy was formed in the first place.

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:06.260
You brought Ibuki-sama's bag as well?

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.250
Yes, Brother.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:14.080
Will Sumomo-sama be OK?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.540
I don't know.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.300
We can't even go visit her.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:21.230
From their perspective, we're enemies.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:25.850
I had tried to avoid involving others no matter the cost...

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:29.270
Can't we stop Ibuki-sama?

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:34.380
We of the Kamijou family cannot oppose her.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:38.360
Even if she is wrong, we must obey her.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:39.990
Yes, ever since that day...

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.450
If only I hadn't said that...

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:45.940
It's the same with me.

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:54.780
Saya...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.420
Don't cry anymore.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:01.550
What's wrong, Shinya?  Saya?

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:04.350
Father...

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.980
Why don't we have a mother?

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:10.710
We got a homework assignment at school.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:15.080
Mother's Day is coming, so we were asked to draw a picture of our mother.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:20.290
The teacher said that those without mothers didn't have to do it.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.050
I want to see my mom...

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.310
Don't say that, Saya!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.490
Our mom has passed on!

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:28.890
Don't beg for the impossible!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.640
Do you want to see your mother, Shinya?  Saya?

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.990
But that's impossible...

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.960
If it were possible?

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:40.880
Yes.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:41.780
Yes.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:44.200
I'd imagine so.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.620
Saya, wake up!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:03.990
What?

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:09.020
Souya-sama took the treasure of the Shikimori!

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.150
Our father did?

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:23.410
Shinya!  Saya!

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.460
I will let you see your mother...

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:30.400
...with the power of the treasure of the Shikimori family!

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:45.590
A demon?!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:15.700
The Kamijou's father did that?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:21.960
Normally the power of the Shikimori family's treasure is to steal demons.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:27.680
But it was said that depending on how you used it, it could also revive the dead.

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:28.800
But...

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:33.490
He failed and released all the demons that were sealed, right?

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:38.550
Only those with the power of magic could defeat the demons.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:43.070
The Minagi family and Takamine families, which are deeply connected to the Shikimori family,

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:46.400
went in force to seal the demons again, but...

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.740
<i>Di Vana Dina!</i>

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.580
There's no end to them, huh, Suu-chan?

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:21.370
Yuzuha!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.810
I expect we need to cut it off at the source.

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:27.530
Stop the treasure, you mean?

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:28.550
Yeah.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:30.690
It's totally out of control.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.210
It's impossible!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:37.420
But I may be able to stop it if I sacrifice my life.

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.950
<i>What's wrong, miss?</i>

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:53.730
Someone is going to die...

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:54.900
<i>No way!</i>

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:05.560
That was the first time I ever used divination magic.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:07.660
<i>It was, wasn't it.</i>

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:12.380
I never want to make such a painful prediction again.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:15.910
Yuzuha?  You mean Takamine Yuzuha, the director of the school?

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:18.140
Takamine-senpai's mom?

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.590
She's totally fine!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.270
She's on vacation in England now, right?

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:26.970
That's right, she said she wanted to have some real scotch...

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.720
Yes, Yuzuha's doing fine.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:34.920
But someone else lost their life then.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:40.180
Suu-chan, I'm leaving the rest to you.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.320
Natsume!

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:46.640
Natsume-chan...

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:47.520
Wait, please.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:53.000
The responsibility for this lies with me as the next master of the Shikimori house.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.640
If you do that, you'll...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.770
<i>Di Latil Amalest!</i>

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:14.250
Yuzuha-san, you can see how this is going to end.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.020
W-Well...

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.380
Suzuri-san, I leave the rest to you.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.390
Natsune!

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:30.200
That's demon-sealing magic...

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:46.260
Natsune!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.700
Suzuri-san...

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:08.890
Seal the treasure here...

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:12.560
Please.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.410
Sister...

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:55.960
It was Natsune-san who died then, Ibuki-san's sister.

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.470
I can't turn back now.

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:19.410
Until I gain the treasure of the Shikimori...

00:23:55.010 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.440 --> 00:23:57.120
This is Kamisaka Haruhi!

00:23:57.120 --> 00:24:01.850
Yesterday I had the opportunity to talk to someone who's a master of preview commentary!

00:24:01.850 --> 00:24:06.380
According to them, at the end of each preview you're supposed to say the same thing.

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:13.060
So I thought to myself, what about "It's a happy and heartful school life!"

00:24:13.060 --> 00:24:16.020
What?  There's only one more preview after this?

00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:19.140
B-But I'll do it starting this episode.

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:21.090
Next time:  The Treasure of the Shikimori!

00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>The Treasure of the Shikimori</b>

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:22.690
It's a happy and heart-

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:24.990
I-I'm out of time?!
